# 🚤 ABoat — ESP32-Based Smart Boat Controller

**A project by Andrey Shamis**  
Autonomous and remote-controlled boat platform based on **ESP32**, with integrated **MPU9250**, **TinyGPS++**, and **FlySky PPM input**.

---

## 📦 Features

- ✅ Dual ESC motor control (left/right)
- ✅ Rudder servo control with trim and angle logic
- ✅ PPM (FlySky) input with channel reading
- ✅ GPS parsing with TinyGPS++
- ✅ Orientation tracking via **MPU9250** + **Fusion/Madgwick AHRS**
- ✅ State machine logic for motor control
- ✅ Modular structure (rudder, motor, flysky, settings)
- ✅ PlatformIO-ready

---

## 🧠 Hardware Used

- ESP32 board (Heltec Stick Lite v3)
- MPU9250 9-axis IMU
- Neo-6M or similar GPS module (UART)
- FlySky FS-iA10B (PPM on pin 23)
- 2x ESCs (PWM control)
- Rudder servo
- Power supply: 2–3S Li-Ion

